  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "不動產行銷管理",
    "sub_ename": "REAL ESTATE MARKETING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程講授行銷相關理論與不動產行銷管理之實例，包括不動代銷之行銷計畫、市場調查分析、定價策略銷、售現場人員管理及不動產仲介物件銷售，再藉由分組模擬演練使學生可以瞭解不動產行銷理論應用與實務操作。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will focus on marketing theory and real estate marketing examples, including real estate agency marketing planning, market research and analysis, pricing strategies, sales force management, and real estate brokerage property sales management. It enables students to understand real estate marketing theory application and practical operation.",
